@startuml
title UC-07: Seller confirms COD
start
:Seller opens own order portion;
if (Owner and Pending Payment?) then (no)
  :Return not-found or conflict;
  stop
endif
:Seller attests cash received outside application;
:Begin PostgreSQL transaction;
:Mark own portion Paid and append audit;
if (All Seller portions Paid?) then (yes)
  :Customer order shows Paid;
else (no)
  :Customer order remains Pending Payment;
endif
:Commit transaction;
stop
@enduml
